  "description": "French Avenue Vulcan Black Friday is a bold leather-spicy fragrance built for intensity, confidence, and dark sophistication. Released in 2025, this scent blends warm spices, rich leather, and earthy woods to create a powerful masculine signature. The opening delivers a striking mix of saffron, crisp apple, and cinnamon, creating a spicy-fruity introduction that immediately grabs attention. The heart develops into a deep leather accord balanced by elegant rose, adding richness and smooth character. The base settles into patchouli, moss, musk, and papyrus, producing a dark, earthy trail that feels smoky, powerful, and long-lasting. Vulcan Black Friday is ideal for evening wear and colder seasons, delivering a commanding presence with a sophisticated leathery finish.",
